note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note Parked-buffer scan from src/omega_gpu_session.c. A buffer is still parked
note when its handle index and generation both match a live slot. Pure lookup:
note the C shell owns the parked table and the generation bump.
fn scan idx view ulong 512 gen view ulong 512 want ulong wgen ulong to ulong
i = ulong 0
while lt i 512
if eq get idx i want
if eq get gen i wgen
ret 1
end
end
i = add i 1
end
ret 0
end
